          "instanceTitle": "AFNO-lite PDE forecasting (CPU)",
          "text": "# AFNO-lite forecasting scaffold (CPU-friendly)\n\nThis template captures the core FourCastNet inductive bias in a simplified setup:\n- **Spectral token mixing over spatiotemporal fields** (`afno_lite_spatiotemporal_model`)\n- **Autoregressive next-step field prediction** on synthetic 2D PDE data\n- **Compact defaults** that train on CPU\n\nThe data source is `diffusion_pde_dataset` (not ERA5). For paper-level weather forecasting, add a real reanalysis dataset node later."
